{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout history, many civilizations have fought for supremacy. Empire Earth Reforged invites you to experience a realistic experience with a touch of nostalgia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You choose your strategy mode with one of the game's civilizations, each with unique and shared units, or create one your own. Keep in mind that you can start from humanity's humble beginnings to the heights of human progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll feel like there's always something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25A wide variety of units for each era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf33Units traversing forests (although it's unclear whether this will remain).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0fClosed unit formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0Intuitive building layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdcCampaigns in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a123 civilizations can be played with unique and shared units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaeMultiplayer server set aside to avoid incompatibility,\u00a0but it is recommended to make sure that all players have the same version</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TECHNICAL DETAILS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fSometimes the screen freezes, in which case use Alt+Tab to return to the game or close it with task manager, it is a bug that still needs to be patched.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GRATITUDE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atlasfield, Philla, Capybara, JoseMa36, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Energycube, Zocker, Fortuking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Epo, Jan Kutac and Agrael</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\